flowchart LR
    Skill[SKILL.md instructions]
    Model[Model proposes command]
    Detector[Implicit attribution detector\nrecognizes runner/script path]
    Router[Tool router / registry]
    Policy[Approval policy]
    Sandbox[OS or remote sandbox]
    Exec[Shell / unified-exec runtime]
    Process[python/bash/node/etc. process]
    Output[Bounded output + call_id]
    Telemetry[Skill attribution telemetry]

    Skill --> Model
    Model --> Router
    Router --> Detector
    Detector -. attribution only .-> Telemetry
    Router --> Policy
    Policy -->|allow| Sandbox
    Policy -->|ask/deny| Output
    Sandbox --> Exec --> Process
    Process --> Output
    Output --> Model
